<title>UK: Deutsche sets put warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets put warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets has issued 600,000 European-style put warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    $752.15		   PREMIUM	4.18 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $31.44		    GEARING	23.92 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   09.JUL.97		 PAYDATE	30.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  $752.15</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
